node_modules

# The Android build, served at /download/xelvic.apk.
#
# `dist/` is committed in this repository, which is right for built pages —
# they are text, they diff, and a deploy can be read before it goes. A 73 MB
# binary is the opposite of that: it does not diff, it cannot be reviewed, and
# every release would add another copy to the history for ever. So the file
# lives in `public/download/` and is *not* tracked; `npm run build` still
# copies it into `dist/`, so it ships with the site exactly as if it were.
# The one line that puts a fresh build there is in DOWNLOAD.md.
public/download/*.apk
dist/download/*.apk
